<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="HOS" style="id">Hosea</book>
  <para style="h">Hosea</para>
  <para style="toc1">Hosea</para>
  <para style="toc2">Hosea</para>
  <para style="mt">Hosea</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Judah siangpahrang Uzziah, Jotham, Ahaz le Hezekiah pawl siangpahrang an ṭuan san le Israel siangpahrang, Joash fapa Jeroboam in siangpahrang a ṭuan laiah Bawipa ih thu cu Beeri fapa Hosea hnenah a ra.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Bawipa in Israel miphun hnenih a ṭong tikah hmaisa bik ah Hosea hnenah, “Feh awla nupi va ṭhi aw; na nupi cu hlawhhlang a si ding ih na faale pawl khal an nu vek an si ding. Ka miphun in in tlansan zo ih hlawhhlang phun ah an cang zo,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Curuangah Hosea cun Gomer a ṭhit. Gomer cu Diblaim fanu a si. Fa a vun ih fapa a hring.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Cutikah Bawipa in Hosea hnenah, “A hminah ‘Jezreel,’ sak aw; ziangahtile Israel siangpahrang ih pu Jehu in Jezreel khua ih mi a rak thah ruangah a rei hlanah Israel siangpahrang ka hrem ding a si. Jehu tesinfa pawl ih uknak san cu ka cemter ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Cule Jezreel phairawn ah Israel ralkap pawl ih cahnak cu ka siatsuah ṭheh ding a si,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Gomer in fa pahnihnak a hun nei ih fanu a si. Cule Bawipa in Hosea hnenah, “A hmin ah ‘Lo-ruhamah,’ sak aw; ziangahtile Israel mi pawl cu ka lainat nawn lo ding ih ka ngaidam nawn lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Asinain Judah mi pawl cu ka lainat ding. Bawipa an Pathian keimah in ka run ding; asinain cutiih ka run tikah raldonak ralnam, li le thal, rang le rangralkap thawn ka run lo ding,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Gomer in a fanu cu pawhte fawp a baanter hnuah fa a vun sal ih fapa a hring.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Cutikah Bawipa in Hosea hnenah, “A hmin ah ‘Lo-ammi,’ sak aw; ziangahtile nannih Israel mi cu ka minung nan si lo ih kei khal nan Pathian ka si lo,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Israel miphun cu tifinriat ih vunnel zat an si leh ding; tah cawk lo le siar cawk lo an si ding. Atu-ah Pathian in, “Israel cu ka minung a si lo,” a ti. Asinain “Nannih cu a nungmi Pathian ih faate nan si,” a ti ni a ra thleng leh ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Judah mi le Israel mi cu an kom-aw sal ding. Anmah hrangah hruaitu pakhat an hril ding ih a hlanlai vekin an ram sungah an karhzai ding ih an ṭhangso ding. Asi, Jezreel san cu san maksak a si ding.
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Curuangah nan unau Israel mi pawl cu “Pathian minung,” tiah le “Bawipa Ih Duhmi,” tiah ko uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ka faale pawl, nan nu hi sim hnik uh; amah cu ka nupi a si lo maw? Keimah cu a pasal ka si lo maw? A uiretnak le hlawhhlang a sinak baang dingah sim uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A baang lo asile a nuih pum sung ihsin a suah lai ih lawngfangkheh ih a um vekin a hnipuan ka hlit ding. Leilung ro le lei caar bangin ka tuah ding ih tihal in a thi ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A faate pawl hnen khalah zaangfahnak ka nei lo ding; annih cu ningzah thiam lo hlawhhlang nu ih faate an si! Anih cun, “I duhtu hnenah ka feh ding; ti le rawl, tuuhmul le puan, olif hriak le sabitti in pe paam,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Curuangah a lamzin khamnakah hruang ka tuah ding ih hling le so in amah cu a kimvel in ka kulh ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Amah a ngaitu pawl kha an dung in a dawi ding naón a man lo ding. A hawl rero ding naón a hmu lo ding. Cule anih in, “Hmaisa ka pasal hnenah ka kir sal ding. Atu hnakin tuih hlanah ka rak nuam sawn,” tiah a ti ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />A hnenah rawl, sabit, olif hriak le Baal biaknak ih a hmanmi sui le ngun pawl a petu cu keimah ka si hi a thei dah lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Curuangah ka pek ciami rawl le sabit pawl cu rawl lak caan ah ka lak kir ding; a hnipuan hrang ka timi tuuhmul le patpuan pawl tla ka lak sak kir ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />A hnipuan ka hlit ṭheh ding ih a mi ngaimi hmaiah a lawngfangkheh in ka umter ding; ka kut sungin zohman in an run thei lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />A nomnak puai pawl: kumtin puai le thlatin puai pawl, Sabbath puai le biaknak lam puai pawl cu ka cemter ṭheh ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />“I ngaitu pawl ih in phalh mi,” a timi a sabit hmuan le a theipi kung pawl ka siatsuah ṭheh ding. A sabit hmuan le a thingrah hmuan pawl cu ramṭhing ah ka tuah ṭheh ding ih hramlak ramsa in an siatsuah ṭheh ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Keimah hngilh tahrat in Baal hnenah rimhmui a ur ih a mi ngaimi pawl hrangah a ṭhirual le a hnakhai khaih tahrat ih a thlun reronak caan ai-ah amah ka hrem ding. Hitiin Bawipa in a sim zo a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Curuangah amah cu nelrawn ah ka hruai kir sal ding ih duhdawtnak ṭongkam thawn ka leem ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />A sabit hmuan pawl cu ka pe kir ding ih Harsatnak Nelrawn cu ruahsannak sangka ah ka tuahsak ding. A no lai Izipt ihsin a suah lai vek khan ka lam a hoi sal ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Cuticun “Ka Pasal,” tiah i ko sal ding ih, “Ka Baal,” tiah i ko nawn lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Baal hmin cu ka saalter nawn lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Cutikah cun ka minung pawl an tuahmawh lonak dingah leilung par ramsa le van ih zam vate le leilung ih a bokvak pawl thawn thukamnak ka tuah ding. Raldonak hriamnam pawl: ralnam pawl le li le thal hmuahhmuah ka hlonhlo ṭheh ding ih ka minung pawl cu hnangamte le himte in khua an sa ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Maw, Israel, ka nupi ah ka lo tuah ding; Mifel le rintlak ka si ding, A hmunmi duhdawt zaangfahnak Na parah ka langter ding ih, Kumkhua in ka ta na si ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ka thukam ka hngetter ding ih, ka ta na si ding; Kei hi Bawipa ka si kha na thei ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Cutikah ka minung Jezreel ih thlacamnak ka theihsak ding ih, Leilung ah ruah ka surter ding. Cule leilung in rawl le sabit le olif pawl a suahter sal ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Ram sungah ka minung pawl cu ka um hngetter ding. An ṭhangso ding ih mi neinung zet an si ding. “Lo-ruhamah,” tiih rak kawhmi pawl cu “Ka zaangfah ding,” ih, “Lo-ammi,” tiih rak timi pawl cu “Ka minung nan si,” ka ti ding. Cule annih in “Kan Pathian na si” tiah in ti ding.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Bawipa in hiti in i sim sal: “Va feh awla midang a ngaitu hlawhhlang nu cu va duh aw. Israel mi pawl in pathian dangdang an bia ih milem pawl hnenah sabit caar an pe rero naón annih cu ka duhdawt thotho vekin nang khal in cu nu cu na duh thotho ve pei,” i ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Curuangah cu nu leinak ah ngun tangka hleinga le barli fang han sarih ka pek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Amah cu, “Caan reipi hlawhhlang na ṭuan nawn lo pei; midang khal na ngai nawn lo pei. Ka hnenah na um ding naón ka hnenah na it hrih lo pei,” tiah ka sim.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Cumi bangtuk in Israel mi pawl khal siangpahrang nei lo le hotu nei loin, thawinak pe thei loin le lungto ṭhuamthiang nei loin, zuk le tinzohnak milem pawl nei loin reipi an um ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Asinain Israel mi pawl in Bawipa an Pathian lam ah an hoikir ih an siangpahrang David ih tesinfa hnen an pan sal caan a um leh ding. Cule Bawipa cu an ṭihzah ding ih a laksawng ṭha an ngah ding.
  </para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Bawipa in hi ram sungih a ummi pawl parah mawhthluknak a nei a si. Maw Israel, a simmi hi ngai hnik: “Hiram sungah hin duhdawtnak a um lo ih rintlak sinak khal a um lo. Minung pawl in an Pathian ah in ruat lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Mi an camsiat, thuphan an per, mi an that, ruk an ru, nupi le pasal pawl in midang an ngai san. Thisen luannak a karh vivo ih mi thahnak pakhat hnu pakhat a um.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Curuangah hi ram cu a caar ding ih ram sungih nunnak a neimi hmuahhmuah an cau ṭheh ding. Ramsa le vate hmuahhmuah le nga hman an thi ṭheh ding,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Bawipa in, “Zohman in misenpi pawl mawhthluk hlah hai seh; a kawk khal kawk hlah hai seh. Ka mawhthluk mi cu nanmah puithiam pawl nan si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />A sun a zan in sualnak poimawh nan tuah; nannih hnakin profet pawl an ṭha cuang fawn lo. Nan nu Israel hi ka siatsuah ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ka minung pawl in keimah in theih duh lo ruangah an cem thla ding. Nannih puithiam pawl khal in in thei duh lo ih ka thuzirhmi pawl nan hlon. Curuangah nannih cu ka lo hnong ih nan fapa pawl khal ka puithiam an si thei nawn lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />“Puithiam nan tam deuhdeuh ih ka parah nan sual deuhdeuh. Upat tlak nan sinak cu nan mualphonak ah ka tuah ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ka minung pawl ih sualnak thawngin milian ah nan cang; curuangah tam sinsin in sualter nan duh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Misenpi vek thotho in cawhkuannak nan tuar ve ding. Thil ṭha lo nan tuah ruangah ka lo hrem ding ih ka lo cawh ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Raithawinak pekmi sungin nan covo cu nan ei ding naón nan ril a rawng thotho ding. Hlawhhlang nan ṭuan ih punzainak khawzing nan bia rero ding naón faate nan nei cuang lo ding, ziangahtile khawzing dang thlun duh ah ka hnen ihsin nan pial a si,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Bawipa in, “Zu thar in siseh zu hlun in siseh ka minung pawl ih thinlung a hloter ṭheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Thingtan hnenah tin an leeng, funghreu in an duhmi a rak sim. Curuangah kei cu in tlansan. Hlawhhlang ih a cangmi nunau vekin annih cu khawzing dang hnenah an pe aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tlangzim hmunthiang ah thawinak an tuah ih tlangpar thingpi sang sasua kiing daihnem ṭha hnuai ah rimhmui an ur. “Curuangah nan fanu pawl cu hlawhhlang ah an cang ih nan fapa ih nupi pawl cu mipa dang thawn an sual.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Asinain hi ruangah ka hrem hai lo ding; ziangahtile nanmah hman biakinn hlawhhlang pawl hnenah nan feh ih anmah thawn hmunkhat ah thawinak nan pek. Thufim ih a um vekin, ‘Ruahnak nei lo miphun cu an siat ding.’
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />“Nannih Israel mi pawl cu ka hrangah hlawhhlang ah nan cang zo naón Judah mi cu cuvekin si hram hlah hai seh. Gilgal a si lole Bethaven ah i bia hlah hai seh. Cutawk hmunah a nungmi Bawipa ih hmin in thukamnak tla tuah hlah hai seh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Israel mi pawl cu laak lungruh bangin an lung a ruh a si. Ziangtin so tuufaate bangin tlimno lakah ka cawm thei ding?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Israel mi pawl cu milem in a ham ṭheh a si. An duhnakah feh hai seh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Zu tampi an in hnuah hlawhhlang an ṭuannak ah nuam an ti zet ih hmin ṭhatnak hnakin thangsiatnak an duh sawn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Phusiing ih semhlomi vekin ṭhekdarh ṭheh an si ding ih an khuavang biaknak cu an zahpi ding.
  </para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />“Nannih puithiam pawl hihi ngai uh. Nannih Israel mi pawl, ṭhatein ngai uh. Siangpahrang sungkhat pawl, ngaihnik uh! Dingnak thawn thuṭhentu ding nan si naón nan parah thuṭhennak a thleng ding. Mizpah ah thang ah nan cang zo; Tabor tlang ah mi awktu sur ah nan cang ih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Akhesia khua ah mi tlaknak khur thukpi ah nan cang zo. Curuangah nan zatein ka lo hrem hai ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Israel thuhla cu ka thei ṭheh; ka hnen ihsin a thup-aw thei zik lo. Rintlak lo a si zo ih a minung pawl cu keimah bia dingah an tlak lo,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Misenpi in thil ṭha lo an tuah ruangah Pathian hnenah an kirnak ding a kham. An thinlung ah hlawhhlang ṭuan duhnak a khat ih Bawipa an thei nawn lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Israel mi pawl ih puarthaunak kha anmah mawhphurhtu bik a si. An sualnak in a bahter ih an tlu; Judah mi khal an hnenah an tlu ve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />An tuu le an caw pawl thawinak ah Bawipa hnenah an pek, asinain an hrangah a ṭhahnem lo. Bawipa an hmu thei lo, an hnen ihsin a tlan zo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Bawipa ih hmaiah rintlak lo ah an cang zo; an faate pawl Bawipa ta an si nawn lo. Curuangah an ram cu siatsuah a si cing ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Gibeah ah raldonak tawtawrawt tum uh! Ramah ah tiarawknak tawtawrawt tum uh! Bethel ah raldo auhnak au ciamco uh! Benjamin mi pawl, raldonak ah feh uh!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Hremnak ni a thleng zik thlang; Israel cu siatsuah a si ding. Israel mi pawl, hi thil hi a cang tengteng ding sokhaw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Bawipa in, “Judah in Israel a do ih a ram a lon ruangah ka thin a heng. Curuangah an parah hremnak cu tilian bangin ka burh ciamco ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Israel cu namsuknak a tuar; zianghman pek ding a nei lotu hnenah bomnak dil in a pan ringring ruangah amah ih ram rori a si mi a sung zo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Israel parah siatsuahnak ka thlenter ding ih Judah mi parah siatralnak ka tlunter ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Israel in a nat a luar zia a hmuh tikah le Judah in a hma a besiat zia a theih tikah, Israel cu a cakzetmi Assiria siangpahrang hnenah bomnak dil dingah a feh; asinain an natnak siseh, an hma siseh a damter thei lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Israel le Judah cu kiosa in ṭilva a nam vekin ka nam ding. Keimah rori in ka thlekbauh ṭheh ding ih ka tlansan ding. Ka hnuk vivo hai tikah zohman in an run thei lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />“An sualnak ruangah tawkfang an tuarta ih keimah in ra hawl sal hlanlo cu ka minung pawl hi ka dungtun hrih ding. An tuarnak ruangah keimah kha a hawl in tum dah pangah,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Misenpi in, “ Bawipa ih hnenah kirsal uhsi. In bauhthlek ṭheh zo naón amah thotho in in damter ding. In tuahmawh zo naón amah thotho in kan hma in tuam sak ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ni hnih hnuah in thoter sal ding ih ni thumnak ah in nungter sal ding; cule a hmaiah a nung in kan um ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Bawipa cu theih tum uhsi. Amah cu kan hnenah zinglam khawvang bangin a ra ding, a pelh lo ding. Amah cu kan hnenah leilung a toihtu ṭoruah bangin pelh loin a ra thleng ding,” an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Bawipa in, “Maw Israel le Judah, nannih hi ziangtinso ka lo tuah ding? In duhdawtnak cu zinglam suumzing bangin zamrang in a hlo; daitla bangin a hul lohli.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Curuangah ka profet pawl nan hnenah thuṭhennak le siatsuahnak ṭong thawn ka thlah a si. Nan hnen ihsin ka duhmi cu nanmah ih theih lo ding zianghman a um lo; tleunak bangin a fai a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Nan hnen ihsin a ṭunghmun mi duhdawtnak a si ka duh, ramsa ih raithawinak a si lo. Keimah in theih ding a si ka duh, mei-ur thawinak a si lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />“Sikhalsehla hi minung pawl, hi tiamkammi ram an thlen vete in annih thawn thukamnak ka tuahmi cu Adam hmun ah an bal ṭheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Gilead cu mi ṭha lo le mi thattu pawl ih khua a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Puithiam pawl cu damiah bangin mi an bawh. Shekhem hmun thianghlim fehnak lamzin hmanah mi an that. Cuih thil ṭha lo pawl cu tumhrim in an tuah!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Israel ram sungah thil poimawhzet pakhat ka hmu: ka minung pawl in milem biaknak in an baal-awter ṭheh zo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />“Nannih Judah mi pawl, nan thil tuahmi ruangih hremnak nan tuar ding tikcu ka khiah zo.
  </para>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />“Ka minung Israel damter ka tum ih ṭhangsoter sal ka duh naón an ṭhatlonak le thil sual an tuahmi lawng ka hmu. Samaria ah pakhat le pakhat an bum aw; inn an bauh ih thil an ruk; lamzin ah mi thil an long.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Thil ṭha lo an tuahmi hi ka ciing ringring ding ti an ruat baan hrimhrim lo; an sualnak in a kulh ṭheh kha hmu loin ka um thei fawn lo,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Bawipa in, “Miseenpi in an siangpahrang le an bawi pawl an bum an phiar ih an lung an tluanter.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />An zatein ṭaangṭawm sualnak tuahtu an si ih rintlak lo hlir an si. Sang tuahtu in sang a nawng ih meisa lingzet parah sang a rawh ih a lingzet vekin an mi huatnak cu a ling ringring a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Siangpahrang in puai a tuah ni ah siangpahrang le a kut thuai bawi pawl cu zu an ri ih mi aa vek an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />An mi phiarnak cu meisa vekin a ling. An thinhengnak cu zanvar a sa ih zinglam ahcun meisa alh bangin a hliau.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />“An thin a sa tukih anmah uktu pawl an thah. An siangpahrang cu pakhat hnu pakhat an that naón bomnak dil in zohman ka hnenah thla an cam lo,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Bawipa in, “Israel mi cu a hrek lawng a hminmi sang bangtuk an si. An kiangkap ih miphun dang pawl an rinsan ih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />ramdangmi an rinsan ruangah an thazaang a nau ti kha an thei lo. Reipi an nung nawn lo ding; cu khal an thei cuang lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />An puarthaunak kha an sualnak langtertu a si. Hi bangtuk thil a cang ṭheh hnu khalah hin Bawipa an Pathian keimah ih hnenah an kir duh lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Israel cu ruahnak nei lo laileng aa bangin a vak; hmaisa ah bomnak dil in Izipt ah a feh; neta ah Assiria hnenah a tlan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Sikhalsehla anmah kaihnak ah sur ka siah ding ih an feh phah ah vate bangin ka awk ding. Thilsual an tuah ruangah ka hrem ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />“Mi vanduai an si! In taan zo ih in dodal zo. Annih cu siatsuah an si ding. A hum ka duh hai naón keimah riangri ka thang in siat.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Thinlung ngai in thla an cam lo; thlacam ai ah leilung ah an hlon aw ih Pathian thei lo pawl bangin an aukiau. Rawl le sabit hrangih thla an cam tikah Pathian thei lo pawl bangin an sun aw ciamco. Ziangtluk raltho phun so an si!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Anmah cawmtu le a caktertu cu keimah ka si naón keimah zuarthlaitu riangri ah an cang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Cahnak zianghman a nei lomi khawzing hnenah in pialsan cingcing. Annih cu a kawimi li vekin rintlak lo an si. An hotu pawl cu puarthau zetih an ṭong ruangah sarthih in an thi ding ih Izipt mi pawl in an hnihsan ding,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Bawipa in, “Tawtawrawt tum uh! Ka ram sungah ral pawl cu muvanlai vekin an rung zam. Ka minung pawl in anmah thawn ka thukammi an bal ṭheh ih ka thuzirhmi cu an duh lo a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Kan Pathian a si, kannih cu amah ih minung kan si ih amah cu kan thei a si, an ti naón,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />thil ṭha an dungtun ṭheh a si. Curuangah an ral pawl in an dawi ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />“Ka minung pawl in siangpahrang an hril, asinain anmah ih thu in an hril. Hotu khal an hril, asinain keimah ih lungkimnak a tel lo. An sui le an ngun an suah ih milem ah an tuah; anmah siatsuah awknak hrangah!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Samaria khawpi sung mi pawl in sui cawcang an biak khi ka hua! An parah ka thin a heng ngaingai a si. Milem hi ziangtik tiangso an biak ding? Ziangtikah so an bang ding?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />An milem cu Israel mi kutzungthiam pa ih tuahmi a si; Pathian ngaingai hman a si lo! Samaria ih an biakmi sui cawcang cu denkuai ṭheh ding a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Thli an vorh ih thlipi an khawm ding! A vui um lomi rawl kung cun rawl a suah thei dah lo ding. Rawl a suah thei hmanah ramdangmi in an ei ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Israel cu dolh-mi miphun a si zo; miphun dang pakhat vekah a cang zo ih beel kuai vekin hman tlak lo a si thlang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Hramlak laak bangin a lung a ruh ih amah ih duhmi lamzin lawng a thlun. Assiria bomnak dil duh ah a va tlan. Miphun dangih humnak duh ah a ngaimi hnenah paisa a pek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Miphun dang hnenah a zuar-aw naón atu-ah ka finkhawm sal ding. Reilote-ah Assiria siangpahrang in a hrem ding ih harsatnak nasa zetin an tuar ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />“Israel mi pawl in an sual thianfainak dingah biakṭheng tam deuhdeuh an tuah; asinain cuih biakṭheng pawl cu an sualnak hmun ah a cang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Misenpi hrangah a siar ih siar cawk lo thuzirhnak ka ngan, asinain thu lamdangpi a si-aw, tiin an thlun duh lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Thawinak pek cu an paih zet; thawinak sa ei tla an duh zet. Sikhalsehla keimah an Bawipa cu an parah ka lung a awi lo. An sualnak ka ciing ding ih cuih sualnak ruangah ka hrem hai ding. Cule Izipt ram ah an kir sal ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />“Israel mi pawl in inn ṭhaṭha tampi an sak, asinain anmah siamtu cu an hngilh. Judah mi pawl in phardawl ih kulhmi khawpi tampi an din. Sikhalsehla an khua le an inn ṭhaṭha pawl kaang ṭheh dingah meisa ka thlah ding,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Maw Israel mi pawl, khawvel mi bang ih nan puai tuahnak cu baang thlang uh. Nan Pathian hnen ihsin nan pial zo ih a hmai ah rintlak lo ah nan cang zo. Hi ram pumpi sungah hlawhhlang bangin Baal khawzing hnenah nan zuar aw zo ih, a man in pekmi tiih nan ruahmi rawl in nan lung a lo awiter a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Asinain reilote ah rawl le olif hriak le sabit tla khopkham in nan ngah lo ding. Sabitti thar khal nan ngah nawn lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Israel mi pawl cu Bawipa ih ram sungah an um nawn lo ding. Izipt ram ah an kir sal a ṭul ding ih Assiria ram ih a thiang lomi rawl an ei ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ramdang ahcun Bawipa ih hnenah sabit thawinak an pe thei lo ding ih thawinak dang khal a hnenah an pe thei lo ding. An rawl cun rawl eitu hmuahhmuah a ti borhhlawh ding ih ruakhngah rawl-ei thawn a bang aw ding. An rawl cu an rilrawnnak rehtertu lawng a si ding ih Bawipa ih biakinn ih pekmi ah saan a si lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Cule Bawipa hrangih puai tuah tikcu caan a thlen tikah ziangso an tuah ding?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Hlohralnak a thlen ih misenpi pawl an ṭiodarh tikah Izipt mi pawl in Memfis khawpi ih phum dingah an khawm hai ding. An sui le an ngun a rak umnak, le an inn le an lo a rak dinnak hmun ah hrampi le hlingkung pawl an kho ṭheh ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Hremnak an tuar caan a thleng zo, an parih phulak caan a thleng zo. Cutiin a cang tikah Israel mi pawl in an thei ding. “Hi profet hi a aa a si; hi thlarau lam hmutu hi a molh a si,” nan ti. Nan sualnak a tamtuk ruangah kei cu nasa zetin in hua.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />A minung Israel mi hnenih ralrinnak thu sim dingah Pathian in kei hi profet in i thlah a si. Asinain ka fehnak kip ah vate bangin thang ih awk in tum. Pathian inn sung hman ah misenpi hi profet ih ral ah an cang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />An thil tuahmi cu a ṭha lo tuk ih Gibeah khua ih an rak tuahmi vek a si ko. Pathian in an sualnak cu a ciing ringring ding ih a hrem hai ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Bawipa in, “Hmaisa bikih Israel ka rak hmuh tikah nelrawn ih sabit rah hmuh vek a si. Nan pu le nan pa ka rak hmuh tir ah theipi rah tikcu ih a rah hmin hmaisa bik hmuh vek a si. Sikhalsehla Baal-Peor tlang an thlen tikah cun Baal khawzing biak an thok. Cule a rei hlanah an duh zetmi khawzing pawl vekin ningsinza ah an cang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Israel ih ropitnak cu vate bangin a zuang hlo ding; faate an hring nawn lo ding, an nunau pawl favun an um nawn lo ding ih an sungin nau a seem nawn lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Faate an neih hmanah ka laksak ding ih an nung lo ding. Hi minung pawl ka tlansan tikah cun thil poimawh zetzet an parah a thleng ding,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Israel cu ka hmuh tir ah mawizet ih a khomi tuumkung bangtuk a si; asinain atu-ah an faate pawl cu ramsa bangin dawimi le thahmi an si kha ka hmu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Maw Bawipa hi minung pawl parah ziang tuah ding so ka lo dil ding? An nunau pawl cu cingter ṭheh awla an hnawi cu caarter ṭheh aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Bawipa in, “An thil sual tuahmi hmuahhmuah hi Gilgal ah a thok. Cutawk ihsin anmah huat ka thok a si. Thil sual an tuah ruangah ka ram sung ihsin ka dawisuak hai ding. Ziangtik khalah ka duh sal nawn lo ding; an hotu pawl in an zatein in dodal a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Israel mi pawl cu a hram a caarmi le a rah thei lomi thingkung vek an si. Faate an nei lo ding. An neih hmanah an duh zetmi an fahniang pawl cu keimah in ka that ṭheh ding,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />A hna ka ṭuanmi ka Pathian in a minung cu a hnong ding. Ziangahtile a thu an ngai duh lo. Miphun dang lakah mi vakvai phun ah an cang ding.
  </para>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Israel cu a rah tamzet sabit hri vek a si. An paṭhat deuhdeuh tikah biakṭheng tam deuhdeuh an dawl. An ram in rawl tam deuh a suah tikah an biakmi ṭhuamthiang pawl cu mawi deuhdeuh in an tuah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />An thinlung cu bumnak in a khat ih anmah ih sualnak ruangah an tuar ding. Pathian amah rori in an biakṭheng pawl cu a bal ding ih an ṭhuamthiang pawl cu a khiak ṭheh ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Reilote ah hi minung pawl in, “ Bawipa kan ṭihzah lo ruangah siangpahrang kan nei lo. Asinain siangpahrang cun ziangso in tisak thei cuang ding?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />An ṭong lawnglawng a si ko; thulolak kamawknak le tiamawknak lawnglawng a si. Dingnak cu dinglonak ah a cang ih leileh sungih tur nei hrampi bangin a kho ciamco,” tiah an ti ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Samaria khawpi sungih a ummi pawl cu an thin a phang ding ih Bethel ih an sui cawcang a hloh ruangah an riah a sia ngaingai ding. Anmah le an puithiam pawl cun a cuih cawlem cu an ṭah ding. A mawinak sui hmuahhmuah an lak ṭheh tikah an ṭap an raak ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Cuih cawlem cu Assiria siangpahrang bawipa hnenah siah ai-ah an pek ding. Cawlem biak ding thu a thlun ruangah Israel cu ningzak le mualpho in a um ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Samaria le a siangpahrang cu tidai parih a phuanmi thingtan feemte bangin a fen hlo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Israel mi ih biakmi Aven tlangzim ih milem pawl cu siatsuah ṭheh an si ding. An biakṭheng parah hrampi le hlingkung an kho ding. Mipi pawl in tlangsaang hnenah, “In thup aw,” an ti ding ih tlangte hnenah cun, “In khuh aw,” tiah an ko ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Bawipa in, “Israel mi pawl in Gibeah ih an sualnak thok in atu tiangah ka parih sual hi an cawl dah lo. Curuangah ral in Gibeah ah a man ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Hi misual phun hi ka do ding ih ka hrem ding. Miphun tampi in an bor ding ih an sualnak tampi ruangah hremnak an tuar ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />“Israel cu hlanlai ahcun cawcangte hremṭhatmi fang ciil duhzetmi bangtuk a rak si. Asinain hnaṭuan khung ṭuan thei dingin a mawizetmi a hngawng ah hngawngkol ka thluah. Judah in ṭhee a hnuk ih Israel in ṭhun a hnuk, cutiin lei an let.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />‘Nan hrangah lei thar let uh; dingnak phun uhla ka hnenih nan ṭan man thlawsuahnak vui cu at uh. Nan Bawipa ka hnenih nan kir caan a cu zo; ka ra ding ih nan parah thlawsuahnak ka lo burh ding’ ka ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Sikhalsehla nan tuhmi cu ṭhatlonak a si ih ṭhatlonak vui nan at a si. Nan thuphanpernak rah nan ei zo a si. “Nan rangleng pawl le nan ralkap tamzet nan rinsan ruangah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />nan minung hnenah raldonak a thleng ding ih nan ralṭannak hmuahhmuah siatsuah ṭheh an si ding. Cuih ni cu siangpahrang Shalman in ral a do ih Betharbel khua a siatsuah ih nunau le nauhak pawl a thah ṭheh ni vek a si ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Thil ṭha lo nan tuahmi a tamtuk ruangah cuvek thotho in nannih Bethel minung par khalah a cang ding. Raldonak a thok vete in Israel siangpahrang cu a thi ding,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Israel cu a nauhak lai ihsin ka duhdawt; Ka fapa a si vekin Izipt ram ihsin ka ko suak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Asinain ka fapa ti ih ka ko deuhdeuh tikah ka hnen ihsin a hlat sinsin ah a pial. Ka minung cun Baal hnenah raithawinak an pek; Milem hnen ah rimhmui an ur.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Sikhalsehla Israel feh a zirhtu cu keimah ka si. Ka ṭaang ih a cawitu cu keimah ka si. Asinain anmah damtertu ka si kha an thei lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Duhdawtnak le lainatnak hri thawn ka hruai; Ka cawi ih ka biang ah ka neek cih, Kuun tahratin rawl ka fah a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Asinain ka hnenah an kir duh lo; Curuangah Izipt ram ah an kir sal ding ih, Assiria in a uk hai ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ral in an khua an lak ṭheh ding ih khua kotka pawl an siatbal ṭheh ding. Anmah duhnak lawng an tuah ruangah, Ka minung pawl siatsuah ṭheh an si ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ka hnen ihsin pial an tum ring ring ruangah, An parah hngawngkol bun an si-ih, Cungnungbik hnenah an au rero ding naón sawngtu zohman an nei lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Maw Efraim, ziangtinso ka lo thlah thei ding? Maw Israel, ziangtinso ka lo dungtun thei ding? Admah bang cun ziangtinso ka lo siatsuah thei ding? Zeboiim vek cun ziangtinso ka lo tuahsiat thei ding? Cubangtuk ka lo tuah ding cu ka ruat thei lo; A lo duhtu ka thinlung hi a hlum ih a neem a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ka thinheng in ka lo cawh lo ding, Israel cu ka siatsuah sal lo ding; Ziangahtile kei cu minung ka si lo, Pathian ka si; Nan hnenih a ummi Thianghlim bik cu ka si; Thinheng in ka ra lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />An ral pawl lamah kiosa bangin ka huuk ding ih, Ka minung pawl in in thlun ding. Nitlaknak lam in ṭhia phahphah in in pan ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Izipt ihsin vate bangin zamrang zetin an ra ding; Assiria ihsin thuro bangin an rung ding. An inn ciar ah ka tlunpi ding, Keimah Bawipa in ka ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Bawipa in hiti in a ti, “Israel mi in an thuphan pernak le an mibumnak in in kulh theh. Rintlak le a thianghlimmi Pathian ka si naón Judah mi pawl cun in dodal lai thotho.
  </para>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Zingpit ihsin zanlam tiang Israel mi pawl ih an tuahmi cu thil ṭhahnem lo le siatsuahnak lawnglawng an si. An lakah mi zuarthlainak le thisen suahnak a karh ciamco. Assiria thawn ral remnak an tuah ih Izipt thawn pursum leilawnnak an tuah,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Bawipa in Judah mi pawl mawhthluk ding a nei; Israel pawl khal an nunzia a ṭhat lo ruangah a hrem ding. An tuahmi parah phu a lak ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />An pu Jakob cu a u Esau thawn an nuih pum sungih an um laiah an sual-aw; a hung upat tikah Pathian thawn an buan-aw fawn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Vancungmi thawn an buan-aw ih a neh. Jakob cu a ṭap ih thlawsuah a dil. Pathian cu Bethel ah Jakob hnenah a ra ih thu a sim.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Amah cu Cungnungbik Bawipa Pathian a si; Bawipa ti cu a hmin a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Curuangah Jakob ih tesinfa pawl, nan Pathian cu rinsan uhla atu-ah amah ih hnenah kir uh. Rintlak le dingtein nung uhla, nan Pathian hnaṭuan ding cu thinfualte in hngak uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Bawipa in, “Israel mi pawl cu Kanaan mi pawl vek thotho in an hrokhrawl. An thil leitu pawl kha a dik lo cuai khainak in bum an duh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />‘Kan lian ngah zo, kan nei ngah zo a si. Zohman in thil dik lo in lennak nan ngah tiah in mawhthluk thei lo ding,’ an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Sihmansehla kei hi Izipt ram ihsin a lo hruaisuaktu Bawipa nan Pathian ka si. Nelrawn ih nan hnen ka rat laiah puanthlam sungih nan rak um vek khan ka lo umter sal ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />“Profet pawl hnenah thu ka sim ih langnak tampi ka umter. Profet pawl hmang in ka minung pawl hnenah ralrinnak ka pek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Gilead ah milem an biak ih a biatu hmuahhmuah cu an thi ding. Gilgal ah cawcang in rai an thawi; curuangah biakṭheng pawl cu hramlak ih lungtopen ah an cang ding,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Kan pu Jakob cu Aram ram ah a tlan; cutawkah nupi hlawhnak ah tuu a khal.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Israel mi pawl Izipt saltaannak ihsin suah dingah le kilkhawi dingah Bawipa in profet pakhat a thlah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Israel mi pawl in Pathian cu nasa zetin a thin an hengter; an sualnak ruangah thi tlak an si. Pathian parih thangsiatnak an thlenter ruangah amah in a hrem ding a si.
  </para>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Hlanlai ahcun Efraim hrin an ṭong tikah hrin dang pawl in an rak ṭih ṭheu. Israel hrin dang pawl in Efraim hrin cu an rak zohso. Asinain Baal khawzing biaknak in an sual ih curuangah annih cu an thi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />An sual sinsin ih biak dingah thir in milem an tuah. Minung thinlung in suai copmi ngun milem pawl minung kut in an tuah. Cule, “Cuih milem hnenah raithawinak pek uh,” tiah an ti. Ziangtin so minung in cawcang hmel cuangih tuahmi cawlem cu an hnam thei!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Curuangah hi minung pawl cu zinglam suumzing bangin an hlo ding, daitla bangin an hloral ding a si. Fang cilnak puum ihsin thli ih a seemmi fanghi bangtuk an si ding; meikhu suahnak ihsin a suakmi meikhu vek an si ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Bawipa in, “Izipt ihsin a lo hruaisuaktu cu keimah, Bawipa nan Pathian hi ka si. Keimah siar lo Pathian dang nan nei lo. Keimah lawng hi nanmah runtu ka si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Thlaler ramṭhing le ramcaar ah ṭhatein ka lo kilkhawi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Asinain ram ṭha sungih nan luh tikah nan pum a puar ih nan hna a ngam; cule nan puarthau ih kei cu in hngilh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Curuangah kiosa bangin ka lo nam ding. Tlavang bangin nan fehnak lamzin ihsin ka lo bawh ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />A fano lonmi savompi bangin ka lo zon ding ih ka lo bauhthlek ṭheh ding. Kiosa bangin nan hmun rori ah ka lo maai ṭheh ding ih sahrang bangin cipseksek in ka lo thlek ṭheh ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />“Maw Israel mi pawl, Keimah in ka lo siatsuah ding! Zoso a lo hum thei ding?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Siangpahrang le hruaitu nan ngen. Asinain atu khuiah so an si? Ziangtin so ram pumpi an hum thei ding?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ka thinheng in siangpahrang ka lo pek zo ih ka thinheng ah ka lak sal zo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />“Israel ih sualnak le mawhnak cu cazual parah ṭhatein nganmi a si ih ṭhatein retkhummi a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Israel cu nun theinak tikcu ṭha a nei, asinain a aat ruangah cuih tikcu ṭha cu a laak hna a thiam lo; amah cu a rung suak zikmi naute a nuih pum sungih suah duh lo ih a kir salmi bangtuk a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Himi pawl cu mithi khua Sheol ihsin ka run suak lo ding; thihnak kut sung khal in ka sansuak lo ding. Maw Thihnak, na pulhnat cu run keng hnik aw! Maw Sheol, na mi siatsuah theinak thawn ra aw! Himi pawl parah zaangfahnak zianghman ka nei thei nawn lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Israel cu phaikung bangin no hngualhngi hmansehla nelrawn ihsin nisuahnak lam thli sa ka hrangter ding ih an tipuut le an tikhur pawl a caar ṭheh ding. A thil mankhung hmuahhmuah a siat ṭheh ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Pathian a dodal ruangah Samaria cu hrem a si ding ih a ṭio ding. A minung pawl cu ral kut in an thi ding. An faate pawl cu leilung ah denthat an si ding ih an nunau fa vun lai pawl cu an pum zaithlek an si ding,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Maw Israel mi pawl, Bawipa nan Pathian hnenah ra kir uh. Nan sualnak ruangah nan bah zo ih nan tlu zo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Bawipa ih hnenah kir uhla hiti in thlacam uh: “Kan sualnak hmuahhmuah in ngaidam hram aw; kan thlacamnak in sang awla kan lo kam cia vekin kan lo thangṭhat ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Assiria cun in run thei dah lo ding; kan rangleng pawl cun in hum thei fawn lo ding. Kan kut ih tuahmi kan milem pawl hnenah, ‘Nang cu kan khawzing na si,’ tiah kan ti nawn lo ding. Maw Bawipa bawmtu dang nei lo pawl hnenah zaangfahnak pek ṭheutu na si,” ti uh. Bawipa in hiti in a ti:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />“Ka minung pawl ih hlawhhlannak le vahvaihnak cu ka damter ding; Ka thinlung ngaingai in ka duhdawt hai ding. Ka thinhengnak cu an hnen ihsin a pialsan zo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Israel mi hrangah cun ramcaar ih ruahti bangtuk ka si ding; Lili pangpar bangin an par ding, Lebanon thingkung bangin hnget zetin an kho ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />A hnge a thar in a cerh ding ih, Olif thing vekin a mawi ding. Lebanon in sidar thing bangin An rim a thaw ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Keimah ih thladem thuaiah an um sal ding. Hmuan ah thlaikho an ciing ding ih, Sabit hmuan ih sabit bangin an rah ding. Lebanon sabitti bangin an hmin a thang ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Israel mi pawl cu milem thawn Pehtlaihnak an nei nawn lo ding; An thlacamnak cu ka thei ding ih Ka kilkhawi ringring hai ding. A hnah a hring ringring mi thingkungpi bangin, Ka thladem thuaiah ka ret ding. Keimah cu an thlawsuahnak hrampi ka si,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Mifim hmuahhmuah in hitawk ih nganmi hi thei hai sehla theihthiamnak nei in an thinlung in ciing ṭha hai seh. Bawipa ih lamzin cu a dik ih miding pawl cun cumi lamzin an thlun. Asinain cuih lamzin an zawh lo ruangah misual pawl cu an bah ih an tlu.
  </para>
</usx>
